            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Som S. Biswas1D"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.213,
            0.404,
            0.226
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Received: 20 February 2023 / Accepted: 21 February 2023"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.226,
            0.524,
            0.24
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "© The Author(s) under exclusive licence to Biomedical Engineering Society 2023"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.093,
            0.261,
            0.163,
            0.276
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Abstract"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.091,
            0.277,
            0.909,
            0.374
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "ChatGPT, a language model developed by OpenAI, has the potential to play a role in public health. With its ability to generate human-like text based on large amounts of data, ChatGPT has the potential to support individuals and communities in making informed decisions about their health (Panch et al. Lancet Digit Health 1:e13-e14, 2019; Baclic et al. Canada Commun Dis Rep 46.6:161, 2020). However, as with any technology, there are limitations and challenges to consider when using ChatGPT in public health. In this overview, we will examine the potential uses of ChatGPT in public health, as well as the advantages and disadvantages of its use."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.388,
            0.358,
            0.404
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Keywords chatGPT· Public health· AI"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.435,
            0.441,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "ChatGPT can be used in promoting public health.1,3"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.452,
            0.489,
            0.484
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here are some examples of how ChatGPT can be used in community health:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.499,
            0.489,
            0.545
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) Providing information on public health issues, such as infectious diseases, chronic diseases, and environmental health hazards."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.547,
            0.488,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) Answering questions about health promotion and disease prevention strategies."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.578,
            0.489,
            0.61
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) Explaining the role of community health workers and health educators."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.61,
            0.489,
            0.641
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) Discussing the impact of social and environmental factors on community health."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.642,
            0.489,
            0.674
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) Providing information about community health programs and services."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.703,
            0.441,
            0.736
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Providing Information on Public Health Issues"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.092,
            0.753,
            0.489,
            0.801
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "ChatGPT can provide information on public health issues, such as infectious diseases, chronic diseases, and environmental health hazards, along with examples."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 20,
          "bbox": [
            0.093,
            0.818,
            0.465,
            0.833
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Associate Editor Stefan M. Duma oversaw the review of this article."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 21,
          "bbox": [
            0.51,
            0.434,
            0.882,
            0.469
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Health Promotion and Disease Prevention Strategies"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 22,
          "bbox": [
            0.509,
            0.483,
            0.909,
            0.532
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "ChatGPT can answer questions about health promotion and disease prevention strategies and provide examples. Here are some examples:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 23,
          "bbox": [
            0.51,
            0.546,
            0.909,
            0.625
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(1) Healthy lifestyle choices ChatGPT can provide information about strategies for promoting healthy lifestyle choices, such as regular physical activity, a healthy diet, and avoiding harmful substances, such as tobacco and excessive alcohol consumption."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 24,
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.626,
            0.909,
            0.704
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(2) Vaccination ChatGPT can provide information about the importance of vaccination in preventing the spread of infectious diseases, and answer questions about the types of vaccines available and their recommended schedules."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 25,
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.705,
            0.908,
            0.783
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(3) Screening and early detection ChatGPT can provide information about the importance of regular screening tests, such as mammograms and colon cancer screenings, in detecting diseases at an early stage, when they are more treatable."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.784,
            0.908,
            0.863
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(4) Risk factor reduction ChatGPT can provide information about strategies for reducing risk factors for chronic diseases, such as managing stress, controlling blood pressure and cholesterol levels, and avoiding tobacco and excessive alcohol consumption."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 27,
          "bbox": [
            0.511,
            0.863,
            0.908,
            0.895
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(5) Environmental health ChatGPT can provide information about strategies for protecting environmental"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_footnote",
          "index": 28,
          "bbox": [
